{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-26T20:42:57.041Z","data":{"text":"I completed task 3. Summary of what I did:\n\n**New `src/core/spec/stack-dependencies.ts`** implementing \"Stack dependency state\": `readDependencyState`, `awaitedDependencies` (resolves `depends_on` across `listChanges`), `formatStackedOn`/`parseStackedOn`, and `recordStackedApproval` (deletes any existing stacked approval, copies the checkout folder, appends observations, seals with the checkout hash, writes `.run/approver` and `.run/stacked-on`). Also moved `writeProvenance` here to stay under the 250-line file budget.\n\n**`approve-worktree.ts`** dropped `refuseUnlandedDependencies`; after refusals and review it records a stacked approval when a dependency is approved/archived, otherwise approves into a worktree and clears any stale stacked copy.\n\n**`approve.ts`** now approves the checkout's folder when `findChange` returns a change from a stacked tree, and `ApproveResult` gained `stackedPath`/`waitingFor`.\n\n**`cli/approve.ts`** prints `Waiting for:` and `Stacked:` lines.\n\n**Tests**: updated the unlanded-dependency case in `tests/approve-worktree.test.ts`, and added `tests/approve-stacked.test.ts` covering all nine delta scenarios plus stacked-on format/parse.\n\nBoth the task verify (`node --import tsx --test tests/approve-stacked.test.ts`) and the proposal verify (`pnpm verify`: typechecks, build, full suite, lint) pass. Result written to `openspec/changes/094-stacking/.run/results/3.md`."}}
